vsm2.19:4.1:
Having thus directed his attention to mentality-materiality’s cause and condition, he first discerns
the cause and condition for the material body in this way: “When this body is born it is not born inside a blue,
red or white lotus or water-lily, etc., or inside a store of jewels or pearls, etc.;

vsm2.19:13.1:
KAMMA AND KAMMA-RESULT

Another discerns mentality-materiality’s conditions by means of the round of kamma and the round of kamma-result in this
way: “In the previous kamma-process becoming there is delusion, which is ignorance; there is accumulation, which is formations;
there is attachment, which is craving; there is embracing, which is clinging; there is volition, which is becoming;
thus these five things in the previous kamma-process becoming are conditions for rebirth-linking here in the present becoming.

vsm2.19:13.3:
“Here in the present becoming with the maturing of the bases there is delusion, which is ignorance; there is accumulation, which
is formations; there is attachment, which is craving; there is embracing, which is clinging; there is volition, which is becoming;
thus these five things here in the present kamma-process becoming are conditions for rebirth-linking in the future.
